            "body": "Looks good to me, the new branch matches the existing fp8/mxfp* ones. One suggestion: the other OOT kernel types each have a selection test that registers an OOT kernel and checks init picks it (int8 in test_scaled_mm_kernel_selection.py, mxfp4/mxfp6 in their own files). A small one for fp8_block would cover the new path: register an OOT Fp8BlockScaledMMLinearKernel with kernel_type=\"fp8_block\" and check init_fp8_linear_kernel returns it for a GroupShape(1, 128) activation key on PlatformEnum.OOT.",
